{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced top-down 2D Zombie Shooter with arcade elements.</strong> You control a lone survivor lost in a world full of zombies and strange creatures trying to uncover the mastermind behind all of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in action-packed shootouts from a top-down perspective.</strong> Encounter and defeat strange creatures such as <strong>zombies, aliens, werewolves, vampires, and mutated creatures</strong> as you progress through each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.poster.avif?t=1766213492\" width=308 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.webm?t=1766213492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.mp4?t=1766213492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect supplies and craft items or weapons.</strong> Search for survivors and upgrade your camp to increase its capacity. Unlock new levels by defeating the various bosses you encounter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.poster.avif?t=1766213492\" width=308 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.webm?t=1766213492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.mp4?t=1766213492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey to the world of Zombies and Strangers with a dynamic day-and-night cycle environment</strong>. Experience each level in <strong>spring, summer, autumn, or winter</strong> <strong>season</strong> and encounter different enemy types and bosses as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With 2D pixel art, Zombies and Strangers offers a nostalgic, yet fresh visual style.</strong> it features dynamic effects, fluid pixel animations, and a wide range of enemy types. <strong>2D top-down Environment</strong> ranges from <strong>towns, cities, rocky mountains and beaches</strong>. The game is designed with classic arcade aesthetics, along with fast-paced top-down action and colorful visual effects.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665670?t=1766213492","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/ae83177a640c4a56f2d0d45edeadc159ce40f195/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766213492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/15eaf009b0d55ff42ec378ca5b24fd08987b66d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766213492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/15eaf009b0d55ff42ec378ca5b24fd08987b66d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766213492","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains cartoon-styled violence and gore. \r\n\r\nAlthough the game is in 2D top-down perspective with cartoon-styled pixel graphics, players will engage in top-down shooting combat to defeat zombies and other creatures using different melee and ranged weapons. \r\n\r\nEnemies defeated may display unrealistic bright colored blood effects and cartoon-styled gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced top-down 2D Zombie Shooter with arcade elements.</strong> You control a lone survivor lost in a world full of zombies and strange creatures trying to uncover the mastermind behind all of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in action-packed shootouts from a top-down perspective.</strong> Encounter and defeat strange creatures such as <strong>zombies, aliens, werewolves, vampires, and mutated creatures</strong> as you progress through each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.poster.avif?t=1766213492\" width=308 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.webm?t=1766213492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/3e9c892e3cd65d3a6b3652629a6659c9.mp4?t=1766213492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect supplies and craft items or weapons.</strong> Search for survivors and upgrade your camp to increase its capacity. Unlock new levels by defeating the various bosses you encounter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.poster.avif?t=1766213492\" width=308 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.webm?t=1766213492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/extras/04e4795b0d4a8d5c0ee95a163efb098e.mp4?t=1766213492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey to the world of Zombies and Strangers with a dynamic day-and-night cycle environment</strong>. Experience each level in <strong>spring, summer, autumn, or winter</strong> <strong>season</strong> and encounter different enemy types and bosses as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With 2D pixel art, Zombies and Strangers offers a nostalgic, yet fresh visual style.</strong> it features dynamic effects, fluid pixel animations, and a wide range of enemy types. <strong>2D top-down Environment</strong> ranges from <strong>towns, cities, rocky mountains and beaches</strong>. The game is designed with classic arcade aesthetics, along with fast-paced top-down action and colorful visual effects.</p>","developers":["jieasobi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665670/e547969cbee9e8ebd31b692d012ce96781af2aed/header.jpg?t=1766213492","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665670/871908/f913620a4f25660b1a1d3f95afe877c9d61153d6/1750419162/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745471738","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665670/871908/f913620a4f25660b1a1d3f95afe877c9d61153d6/1750419162/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745471738","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665670/871908/f913620a4f25660b1a1d3f95afe877c9d61153d6/1750419162/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745471738","id":257127066,"name":"